SUMMARY:We Blog
DESCRIPTION:\nWrite\, edit\, publish. \nThis hands-on workshop brings writers together offline to draft\, edit\, and self-publish a blog post. Participants work alongside a small community built around in-person blogging\, with help at every stage: setting up a blog if you don’t have one\, shaping an idea\, sharpening the words\, and finding the nerve to hit publish. Publicly sharing ideas feels daunting\, but anything is possible with a little help from our friends! \nBlogging is hard\, and many people spend years searching for a consistent pace. A community can make the process easier\, and the end result better. A blog offers a blank slate free of social media algorithms\, pairs well with any profession\, and lets you link to references. Posts are open to readers without a sign-up barrier\, and over time they build into an archive of your own thinking. The only ask is a commitment: write on one topic you care about. \nPlease Note: \n\nAdmission is by selection\, with limited seats to foster intentional\, focused interactions.\nPlease bring a laptop and a writing idea\, so you have something to write on and publish from.\n\n\n\nVenue: Boardroom\n\n\n\nPublish on the Web\, Individually but Together\nFor Ages 16+\nRSVPs will open Sun\, Oct 25 at 6pm.\n*Facilitator*: Jatan Mehta\n*Event Categories*: Language\, Technology\, Workshops
URL:https://bangaloreinternationalcentre.org/event/we-blog/
LOCATION:Bangalore International Centre\, 7\, 4th Main Road\, Domlur II Stage\, Bangalore\, Karnataka\, 560071\, India
CATEGORIES:Language,Technology,Workshops
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://bangaloreinternationalcentre.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Thumbnail_WB.jpg
